---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /spana/
title: Spana!
description: >-
  Spana! på Stättareds 4H-gård: hitta detaljerna på bilderna någonstans på gården, bocka
  av dem och se var de sitter.
---
{#-
  The Spana! page (02-§13, ADR 0009, ADR 0024, ADR 0025). Markup only: the round is drawn
  by source/ts/ui/spana.ts from the clues the build lists in the pool below, one
  <template> per clue with the same responsive picture as the rest of the site. The
  templates are inert until the script clones one into a stop, so a large catalogue costs
  the page nothing to load. Without script the page says so (02-§13.4).

  The clue's text and the place it answers ride along as data attributes on the template.
  The place is the answer and is deliberately nowhere else in the markup: it is shown in
  the dialog once the player has said "Hittat!" (02-§13.13). The attribute is `data-place`
  and not `data-location`, because no page on this site writes the word "location" — the
  site never says where an individual animal is (ADR 0012), and the build test guards the
  word itself rather than trusting each template to mean the right thing by it.

  The start screen and the game are two sections; the script shows one of them. The long
  round is offered only when the catalogue holds more clues than the short one, because a
  round never repeats a clue (02-§13.8).
#}
<div class="container container--narrow spana" data-spana>
  <h1>Spana!</h1>

  {%- if views.spana.clues.length > 0 %}
  <form class="spana-start" data-spana-start>
    <p class="lead">Du får några bilder på detaljer som finns på gården. Hitta dem, bocka av dem — och få veta var de sitter.</p>
    <fieldset class="field field--choices">
      <legend class="field__label">Hur lång runda?</legend>
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="size" value="4" checked> Kort runda, 4 stopp</label>
      {%- if views.spana.clues.length > 4 %}
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="size" value="8"> Lång runda, 8 stopp</label>
      {%- endif %}
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset class="field field--choices">
      <legend class="field__label">Hur svårt?</legend>
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="level" value="easy" checked> Lätt — bild och ledtråd</label>
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="level" value="hard"> Svårt — bara bilden</label>
    </fieldset>
    <p><button class="button" type="submit">Börja spana</button></p>
    <noscript><p class="note">Spana! behöver JavaScript. Slå på det i webbläsaren och ladda om sidan.</p></noscript>
  </form>

  <section class="spana-game" data-spana-game hidden>
    <p class="spana-progress" data-spana-progress aria-live="polite"></p>
    <ol class="spana-list" data-spana-list></ol>
    <div class="spana-win note" data-spana-win hidden aria-live="assertive">
      <h2 class="spana-win__title">Allt hittat!</h2>
      <p>Du hittade varje detalj på rundan.</p>
      <p><button class="button" type="button" data-spana-again>Ny runda</button></p>
    </div>
    <p class="spana-restart"><button class="button button--secondary" type="button" data-spana-new>Ny runda</button></p>
  </section>

  <div hidden data-spana-pool>
    {%- for clue in views.spana.clues %}
    <template data-clue="{{ clue.key }}" data-place="{{ clue.location }}"{% if clue.text %} data-text="{{ clue.text }}"{% endif %}>{% picture clue.photo, "(min-width: 680px) 620px, 92vw", false %}</template>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <dialog class="dialog" data-spana-dialog aria-labelledby="spana-dialog-heading">
    <div class="dialog__body">
      <div class="dialog__header">
        <h2 class="dialog__title" id="spana-dialog-heading" data-spana-dialog-title>Stopp</h2>
        <button class="icon-button dialog__close" type="button" aria-label="Stäng" data-spana-dialog-close>
          <svg class="icon-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22">
            <path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="spana-dialog__image" data-spana-dialog-image></div>
      <p data-spana-dialog-text hidden></p>
      <p class="spana-answer" data-spana-dialog-answer hidden></p>
      <div class="dialog__actions">
        <button class="button" type="button" data-spana-dialog-toggle>Hittat!</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  {%- else %}
  <div class="note">
    <h2>Ledtrådarna är inte inlagda ännu</h2>
    <p>
      När ledtrådarna finns på sajten kan du spana efter dem här. Under tiden hittar du
      allt om gården på <a href="{{ site.mainSite }}">4h.se/stattared</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</div>
